                      (        forth.asm):02086         
                      (        forth.asm):02087         * This non-standard word walks through the dictionary linked list and checks
                      (        forth.asm):02088         * that the words that have the MONFLM flag set in their header's attribute
                      (        forth.asm):02089         * field have a definition that still matches the checksum stored in the word's
                      (        forth.asm):02090         * header. This is meant to be used interactively, as a debugging tool, since
                      (        forth.asm):02091         * multitasking is not supported by this implementation. Therefore no status
                      (        forth.asm):02092         * value is returned. Feedback will only be provided for corrupted words, in
                      (        forth.asm):02093         * the form of a diagnostic message printed to the console.
